  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4Youth Coordination and Policy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coordination and policy support for EU action on youth in the EaP region continued with strengthened outreach, partnerships and measurable results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives (Outcomes) of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome 1: EU4Youth initiative is coordinated at programme and country levels, with enhanced strategic partnerships, regular results monitoring as well as communication and EU&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;visibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome 2: EU stakeholders are supported to better engage on youth related policy developments and to conduct policy dialogue on youth-related topics with partner country institutions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
